<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id" />
  <para style="h">NIYABO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Niyabo bot Jon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Niyabo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Niy</para>
  <para style="mt1">NIYABO</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bot Jon</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Niyabo kicoyo ikare ma jo muye Kwena Maber pa Lalarwa Yecu Kricito kitye kayelogi ki nekogi pi ye Yecu Kricito macalo Rwotgi. Ngat ma ocoyo buk man, ma en aye Jon ni, ocuku cwiny jo muye Yecu me cung matek i niye mamegi ikare me ayelayela ki nek malit ma onongo kitye katimone ikomgi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngat ma ocoyo buk man ocwalo kwena bot jo muye Kricito kun tiyo ki carolok ki lanyut madongo malik. I carolok magi en otiyo ki lanyut me kwayi lee mapatpat ma gin lik adada, kacel ki jami mukene calo lakalatwe, pii ki bonyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngeyo telok me lanyut ma i buk man tek tutwal bot jo ma ikare man ento ngeyo tere onongo yot mada bot jo muye Yecu ma ikare ca. Gin onongo ngeyo ni lee man, onyo gin man ocung pi tyen lok ma kit man.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanyut magi ducu cimo kamaleng ni, ikit ayelayela ducu ma lwak ma oye Lubanga limo, Lubanga ki twero ma en omiyo bot Yecu, pud tye laloc dok obibedo laloc matwal. En tye ki twero dok ki kero me loyo lumone ki Catan matwal, dok biculu jo ducu ma lugen ki polo manyen ki lobo manyen.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Waraga bot kanica abiro ma gitye ikabedo abiro mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:9-3:22">1:9—3:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Buk adola matye ki lamwon abiro <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 4:1-8:1">4:1—8:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Buriji abiro ma kikutu <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 8:2-11:19">8:2—11:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Min kulu ki lee aryo ma mager dok lik <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 12:1-13:18">12:1—13:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gin anyuta mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 14:1-15:8">14:1—15:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Atabo abiro ma opong ki akemo pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 16:1-21">16:1-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Balo taun madit me Babilon, loyo lee mager, lunebi ma lugoba, ki Catan <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 17:1-20:10">17:1—20:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 20:11-15">20:11-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Polo, lobo, ki Jerucalem manyen <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 21:1-22:5">21:1—22:5</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Agiki me buk man <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 22:6-21">22:6-21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Man aye gin ma Lubanga onyutu bot Yecu Kricito, wek en bene otit ki lutice ikom gin ma myero otime oyotoyot ikare me anyim. En yam ocwalo lamalaika bot latice Jon wek onge gin mabitime. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Ci Jon oloke odoko lacaden me lok ma Lubanga owaco, dok caden ikom lok me caden mayam Yecu Kricito omiyo, kun bene tito pi gin ducu ma en oneno. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Tye ki gum ngat ma kwano lok ma kitito i buk man inyim lwak. Jo mawinyo bene tye ki gum, ki jo malubu gin ma kicoyo iye bene tye ki gum, pien kare me agiki dong cok.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot bot lwak muye Kricito i kabedo abiro mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Nia 3:14</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 4:5">Niy 4:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lok man oa ki bot Jon ma en ocwalo bot lwak muye Kricito ma gin tye i kanica abiro mapatpat i Acia:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Kica ki kuc obed botwu. Kica man oa ki bot Lubanga matye, mayam obedo tye wa con, dok ma bibino, kun a ki bot cwiny abiro ma gitye inyim komkere, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:4">Ica 55:4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:27">Jab 89:27</ref></char></note> ki ma a bene ki bot Yecu Kricito, lacaden ma gene, latin kayo ki ikin jo ma oto, Rwot madit maloyo luker ducu ma iwi loboni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Deyo obed bot ngat ma marowa, ma nene ogonyowa woko ki i twec me balwa ki remone. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:6">Nia 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:10">Niy 5:10</ref></char></note> En dong olokowa wadoko lwak ma en loyo, kun wadoko ajwaki pa Lubangane ma Wone beneni. Deyo ki twero me loc obed bote nakanaka! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mar 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Luk 21:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:17">1 Tec 4:17</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Jek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:34">Jon 19:34</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:37">37</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Jek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref> </char>
    </note> Nen, en tye kabino ki pol, dano ducu gibinene ki wanggi, kadi jo mayam gucobe; kaka ducu me wi lobo bikumu pire. Kitmeno i ada bitime! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:13">Niy 22:13</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:14">Nia 3:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “An Alpha ki Omega”, man Rwot Lubanga ma owaco, en Lubanga matye, dok mayam onongo tye con, doki ma bibino, en Won Twer Ducu.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kricito onen bot Jon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />An Jon ominwu ma oribe kwedwu i can ki iker ki idiyo cwiny me ciro can ma wabedo kwede i Yecu. Onongo atye icula ma kilwongo ni Patimo, pien onongo atito lok ma Lubanga oloko, ki lok me caden ma Yecu omiyo. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Inino pa Rwot Cwiny Maleng opoto ikoma, kun awinyo dwon malongo ki itung ngeya ma winye calo koko tum ma kikutu. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Owaca ni, <char style="wj">“Coo gin ma itye ka nenone i Bukki, ka dong icwal bot lwak jo muye Kricito ma gitye i kanica abiro mapatpat, matye i Epeco, i Cumurna, i Pergamo, Tuatira, Cardic, i Piladelpia ki i Laodikia.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ci aloke me neno dwon ma onongo tye kalok kwedani. Ikare madong aloke, ci aneno lacib mac me jabu abiro. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:5">Dan 10:5</ref></char></note> I dye lacib mac abironu aneno iye ngat mo ma cal ki Wod pa dano. Dano meno oruke woko ki jor mabor, ki del me jabu ma otweyo ikore. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref></char></note> Yer wiye onongo tar calo yer romo matar, tar calo pee; ki wange bene onongo obedo calo leb mac ma lyel.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Eje 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43:2</ref></char></note> Tyene aryo ducu onongo ryeny calo nyonyo bronze ma kiliyo i keno, ka lacen dong kirudu woko odoko maleng, kun dwone mor winye calo mor pa pii ma core. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Onongo omako lakalatwe abiro i cinge tung lacuc, ki pala lucwan mabit ryoryo okati ki idoge, kun onongo nyime tye ka ryeny calo ceng maryeny matek.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ica 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">Niy 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ma dong anene ci, apoto woko piny katyene calo ngat ma oto. Ento en oketo cinge ma lacuc ikoma kun waca ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ilwor, an aye ngat mukwongo ki me agikine.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" /><char style="wj">An ngat ma kwoni. Yam onongo ato woko, ento kong inen, kombedi atye ma kwo, abibedo kwo matwal. Dok bene atye ki twero ikom to ki ikabedo pa jo ma oto.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" /><char style="wj">Kombedi dong i coo gin ma itye ka nenone ni, gin matye ki gin ma bitime lacen i anyim.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" /><char style="wj">Man aye tyen lok me mung me lakalatwe abiro ma ineno i cinga tung lacuc, ki okar mac abiro me jabu. Lakalatwe abiro gin aye lumalaika pa lwak muye Kricito ma gin tye i kabedo abiro mapatpat, dong okar mac abiro ni gin aye lwak muye Kricito ma gitye i kabedo abiro mapatpat.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Epeco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica matye i Epeco coo kit man ni: Man lok pa ngat ma omako lakalatwe abiro i cinge tung lacuc, matye kawire i dye okar mac abiro me jabu.</char><verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />
    <char style="wj">Angeyo ticwu ducu, ki kit ma wucane kwede ki kit ma wudiyo kwede cwinywu. Angeyo bene kit macalo pe wutwero ciro kwede tim pa jo maracu, ento wutemo jo ma gilwonge ken gi ni gin lukwena, kun gin gigi pe lukwena, ma omiyo bene dong wunongo ni gin lukwena ma lugoba.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" /><char style="wj">Angeyo wutye kadiyo cwinywu, kun wuciro can pi nyinga, dok bene pud pe wuol gire.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" /><char style="wj">Ento atye ki lok man ikomwu, pien dong wuweko mar ma onongo yam wutye kwede mukwongo ca ni woko.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" /><char style="wj">Kong wupo kit macalo onongo wupoto kwede ki i kabedo mamalo mayam wuo iye ni, ka dong wungut, ci wucak tiyo gin ma onongo wubedo katiyone ikare mukwongo ca. Ka pe wungut, ci abibino botwu ka kwanyo lacib macwu woko ki i kabedone.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" /><char style="wj">Gin maber ma onen botwu en aye ni, wudag tic pa jo Nikolaiti ma an bene adagi ni.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aca 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Niy 22:2</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:13">Eje 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng oloko bot lwak ducu ma guye an. Abimiyo ngat ma oloyo camo nyig yat me kwo matye i poto pa Lubanga.”</char><verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Cumurna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ica 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Niy 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica ma gitye i Cumurna coo kit man: Man lok pa ngat ma obedo mukwongo ki me agikine, ngat mayam oto ka dok ocer woko odoko kwo ni.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" /><char style="wj">Angeyo kit ayelayela ducu ma wutye ka cirone, ki can lim bene ma wutye kwede (ento wun wulony). Angeyo bene yet pa jo ma gin waco ni gin Lujudaya, kun i adane gin pe Lujudaya, ento gin gubedo lwak me dul pa Catan.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" /><char style="wj">Pe wulwor can ma bipoto ikomwu. Nen, Catan bikwanyo jo mogo ki ikinwu bologi woko i buc wek etemwu. Gibibedo ka yelowu pi nino apar. Wubed jo ma lugen nio wa i to, ci abimiyowu lalukana me deyo me kwo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">Niy 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">21:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng oloko bot lwak ducu ma guye an. Ngat ma oloyo, to me aryo dong pe biketo arem ikome.”</char><verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Pergamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica ma gitye i Pergamo coo kit man: Man lok pa ngat matye ki pala lucwan mabit ryoryo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" /><char style="wj">Angeyo kama wubedo iye, kama kom pa Catan tye iye. Wun girwu wumako nyinga woko matek liking, pe wukwero niyewu ikoma, kadi ki ikare pa Antipac ma obedo cadena me ada, dano ma lagen mayam kineko ikinwu, kama Catan bedo iye.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:5">Wel 2:5</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 2:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:4">Nwo 23:4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-3">Wel 25:1-3</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento atye ki lok mogo manoknok ikomwu, pien wutye ki jo mogo kunu ma gumako pwony pa Balaam, mayam opwonyo Balak me keto ariya inyim jo Icrael wek gupot i bal, kun obitogi ni gucam ringo ma kityero bot jogi, ki me timo tim tarwang.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" /><char style="wj">Kitmeno, wun bene wutye ki jo mogo ma gumako pwony pa jo Nikolaiti.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" /><char style="wj">Kace pe wungut, ci abibino botwu oyotoyot, ka dong alwenyo kwedwu ki pala lucwan me doga ni.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:14">Nia 16:14</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16:33</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:48-50">Jon 6:48-50</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:2">Ica 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">Ica 65:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng oloko bot lwak ducu ma guye an. Ngat ma oloyo abimiye manna mono ma onongo kikano woko, abimiyo got matar bene bote, ki nying manyen ma kicoyo ikom got meno ma ngat mo pe ngeyo, kono en ngat ma gamo ni keken aye ngeyo.”</char><verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Tuatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica ma gitye i Tuatira coo kit man: Man lok pa Wod pa Lubanga ma wange calo leb mac ma lyel, ki tyene ducu calo nyonyo bronze ma kirudu maleng adada.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" /><char style="wj">Angeyo ticwu ducu, mar ma wutye kwede, niyewu ki ticwu me konyo dano, ki kit ma wudiyo kwede cwinywu. Angeyo ni ticwu ma kombedi wutye katiyone kato me kare mukwongo ca.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Luk 16:31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2 Luk 9:22</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 9:30">30</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento atye ki lok man ikomwu, pien pud wukanyo dako ca, Jejebel, ma lwonge kene ni en lanebini, kun tye ka pwonyo lutica miyo gingak woko i yo me tim tarwang, ki camo ringo mogo ma nongo dong kityero woko bot jogi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" /><char style="wj">Onongo amiyo bote kare me ngut, ento en okwero ngut woko ki ikom tim tarwangeni.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" /><char style="wj">Nen, abibolo dako meno iwi kitanda ma nongo two marac, pacoge bene abibologi woko i can madit atika, ka pe gungut, ma gukwero lubu tim tarwang pa dako meno.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Jab 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Abineko jo malube woko bene, wek lwak ma guye an i kabedo ducu gunge ni an angiyo cwiny dano wa ki tamgi, dok abimiyo bot dano acel acel ikinwu gin malube ki kit tic ma en otiyo.</char><verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ento bot wun jo mukene ma wutye i Tuatira, ma pe wulubu kit pwony man, dok bene pe wupwonyo gin mo ma kilwongo ni ‘Mung matut pa Catan,’ dong atito botwu ni, pe doki abimedo yec mo mukene botwu.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" /><char style="wj">Ento wumak gin ma wutye kwede ni aye matek liking, wang ma an adwogo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8">Jab 2:8</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:9">9</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma biloyo, dok ma bibedo katiyo tica nio iagiki, abimiye twero me loyo lurok.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" /><char style="wj">En biloyogi ki odo nyonyo, calo ngat ma goyo agulu ngidogi woko matinotino, kit macalo an bene alimo twero ki bot Wora;</char> <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" /><char style="wj">an abimiye latwok bene.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng loko bot kanica mapatpat.”</char><verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Cardic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica matye i Cardic coo kit man: Man lok pa ngat matye ki cwiny pa Lubanga abiro, ki lakalatwe abiro. Angeyo ticwu ducu; wutye ki nying me bedo kwo, ento dong wuto woko.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" /><char style="wj">Wuco woko ki iwang nino, wek wujing gin ma pud odong botwu madong cok to ni wek obed matek; pien anongo ni pe wucobo ticwu kakare inyim Lubangana.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12:39</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Niy 16:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Dong wupo ikom gin ma wulimo ki ma wuwinyo; wugwok gin meno ento wunguti. Kace pe wuco woko, ci abibino botwu macalo lakwo, ma pe wungeyo cawa ma abibino kwede ikomwu.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" /><char style="wj">Kadi bed kumeno, pud wutye ki jo mogo manoknok i Cardic ma peya gunyweno bongigi ki cilo. Gibiwot kacel kweda ma nongo guruku bongi matar, pien gin aye gimyero.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Nia 32:32</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Jab 69:28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">Niy 20:12</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat 10:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luk 12:8</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma oloyo kibiruku kitmeno ki bongi matar, dok bene pe abijwayo nyinge woko ki i buk me kwo. Abitucu nyinge inyim Wora, ki inyim lumalaikane.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng loko bot lwak ducu ma guye an.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Piladelpia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:22">Ica 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">Yub 12:14</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica matye i Piladelpia coo kit man:</char> <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" /><char style="wj">Man lok pa ngat maleng ki me ada, ma en aye tye ki layab pa Daudi, en ngat ma ka oyabo ci ngat mo pe dok loro, ka oloro, ci ngat mo bene pe dok yabo. Angeyo tici ducu. Nen, dong atyeko cibo dogola ma oyabe woko inyimwu, ma ngat mo pe matwero lorone. Angeyo ni tekowu nok, ento kadi bed kumeno, dong wumako loka, dok bene pe wukwero nyinga.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:23">Ica 49:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60:14</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:4">Ica 43:4</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Nen, abimiyo lwak me dul pa Catan, jo mayam gubedo ka cayowu ma giwaco ni gin Lujudaya, kun i adane gin pe Lujudaya, ento giloko lok goba, nen, abimiyo gibino giryebe piny ite tyenwu, wek guniang ada ni an amarwu.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" /><char style="wj">Pien wumako loka me diyo cwinywu iciro can, an bene abigwokwu maber ikare me aomo cwiny, matye kabino ikom wi lobo ducu, me temo jo ma bedo iwi loboni.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" /><char style="wj">Abibino oyotoyot. Mak gin ma wutye kwede ni matek liking, wek ngat mo pe omaa lalukanawu woko.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Niy 21:2</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:2">Ica 62:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Ngat ma oloyo, abimiyo doko wir i Ot pa Lubangana, pe bia kato woko ki iye. Abicoyo nying Lubangana, ki nying gang pa Lubangana ikome, Jerucalem manyen ma bia ki i polo bot Lubangana bibino piny, dok bene ki nyinga kikome manyene.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng oloko bot kanica ducu.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kicwalo bot Kanica me Laodikia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:22">Car 8:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“Bot lamalaika pa kanica me Laodikia coo kit man: Man lok ma oa ki bot Amen, ma en aye caden ma gene ki me ada, gin ducu ma Lubanga oketo yam ocake ki ikome.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" /><char style="wj">Angeyo ticwu ducu. Pe wungic, dok bene pe wulyet. Onongo twero bedo ber ka nene wubedo ngic nyo lyet!</char> <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" /><char style="wj">Dong kit macalo onongo wubedo mormor, pe wubedo ngic dok bene pe wubedo lyet, abinguluwu woko ki idoga.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" /><char style="wj">Pien wun dong wuwaco ni, Wan walony, dong watye ki gin ducu mamiyo wabedo ki kwo maber, pe doki wamito gin mo. Ento kun pe wungeyo ni wun aye jo ma piny dong oloyowu atika, ma wuweko kica mako dano ikomwu tutwal, wun lucan, wangwu oto woko, dok bene wutye munero.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" /><char style="wj">Pimeno amiyo ryeko botwu me wilo jabu maleng ma kiliyo woko maber ki mac ki bota, wek omii wudok lulonyo. Wuwil bene bongi matar ki bota me arukawu wek wuum ki lewic me bedo munerowu wek pe dong onen, ki moo bene me wiro wangwu, wek wunen piny.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Car 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Ibru 12:6</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Agoyo jo ma an amarogi, apwonyogi dok atirogi; pimeno wuket tek wek wungut woko.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" /><char style="wj">Nen, acung i dogola kun adwongo. Kace ngat mo owinyo dwona ci oyabo dogola, abidonyo bote ka acamo cam kacel kwede ki en bene camo kacel kweda.</char> <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus standing at the door" file="cn02065B.tif" size="col" copy="David Cook" ref="3:20">Yecu tye kadwongo dogola</figure> <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma biloyo, abimiye twero me bedo kacel kweda iwi komkera, kit macalo an bene dong aloyo ci abedo kacel ki Wora iwi komkereni.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" /><char style="wj">Ngat ma ite tye myero owiny lok ma Cwiny Maleng loko bot lwak ducu ma guye an.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Woro Lubanga i polo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Lacen ka man otum, ci dok aneno dogola mo i polo ma onongo tye twolo. Dong dwon mukwongo ma onongo awinyo obedo kalok kweda calo koko tum kun, waco bota ni, <char style="wj">“It ibin malo kany, ci abinyuti gin ma bitime lacen inge man.”</char> <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Eje 1:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:1">10:1</ref></char></note> Cutcut Cwiny Maleng oyutu tama woko, ci aneno komker ma kicibo i polo, ma dano mo onongo obedo iwiye. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Ngat ma onongo obedo iwi komker ca onongo ryeny calo got me wel matare ki makware, ki danyu manen calo got me wel me emeradi orumu komker woko dyere. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ka dok komker mukene pyere aryo wiye angwen orumu komkere woko dyere, ki ludongo pyere aryo wiye angwen bene gubedo iwi komker magi, ma guruku bongi matar, kun gurwako bene lalukana me jabu me deyo iwigi. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Nia 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">Niy 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:13">Eje 1:13</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:4">Niy 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Jek 4:2</ref> </char></note> Onongo tye gin mo ma wil awila calo lutkot ki ikom komker ni, ki dwon mapol winye iye, ki gin ma mwoc amwoca calo mwoc pa kot. Inyim komker onongo tye iye dog mac abiro matye kalyel, ma gin aye cwiny pa Lubanga abiro. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:22">Eje 1:22</ref></char></note> Inyim komker meno onongo tye iye gin manen calo nam me kiyo maleng calo gweng ma mil amila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Dok lee makwo angwen gurumu komker woko dyere tungi ki tungi, wanggi pol ma mogo tye tung nyimgi ki mogo tye tung ngegi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-10">Eje 1:5-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:14">10:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Lee makwo mukwongo onongo nen calo labwor, ki me aryone onongo nen calo twon dyang, lee makwo me adeke wange nen calo wang dano, ki lee makwo me angwene onongo nen calo ocur matye ka tuk. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Eje 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10:12</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:2">Ica 6:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:3">3</ref> </char></note> Dong lee makwo angweni onongo lee acel acel bwome tye abicel, ma wanggi nongo pol ata, ma oromo komgi woko ducu ki tung woko wa ki tung i iye bene. Dyeceng ki dyewor pe giweko wer ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu leng, leng dok leng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">en ngat mayam tye con, tye kombedi, dok bibino!”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ikare ducu ka lee makwo ni gimiyo deyo ki woro ki pwoc bot ngat ma obedo iwi komker ca, ma bedo kwo nakanaka, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />ci ludongo pyere aryo wiye angweni giryebe piny inyim en ngat ma obedo iwi komker ca, ci giworo en ngat ma bedo kwo nakanakani; dok gibolo lalukanagi inyim komker kun giwero ni,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Rwotwa ki Lubangawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">in imyero me nongo deyo ki woro ki teko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">pien in aye mayam icweyo jami ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">dok bene pi miti ni omiyo gubedo tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">meno aye gin ma omiyo yam kicweyogi.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Buk adola ki Latin romo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:9">Eje 2:9</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 2:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:11">Ica 29:11</ref></char>
    </note> Ci dok aneno buk adola tye itung cing ma lacuc pa ngat ma obedo iwi komkerni, ma kicoyo woko ducu ryoryo, tung iye wa ki itung ngeye bene, dok kimwono ki ginamwona ma kidodo tyen abiro. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Dok aneno lamalaika mo matek tutwal ma onongo tye katito lok ki dwon malongo ni, “Anga ma myero me muku kama kimwononi, kiyabo buk adolani?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Pe tye ngat mo iwi polo, kadi iwi lobo, kadi piny ite lobo matwero yabo buk adola ni kadi wa neno iye bene. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ci akok matek pien pe kinongo ngat mo ma myero me yabo buk adola nyo kadi me neno iye. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Aca 49:9</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ica 11:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note> Cutcut ngat acel ikin ludongo owaca ni, “Pe ikoki. Nen! Labwor ma i kaka me Juda, Lwit yat pa Daudi, en aye dong oloyo, pimeno en twero muku gin amwona abiro ma ki dodo iwi wadi matye i buk adolani woko ci biyabone.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ica 53:7</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Jek 4:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen dok aneno Latin romo ma ocung ikin komker ki lee makwo angwen ki ikin ludongo, manen calo dong kineko woko. Onongo tunge tye abiro, ki wange bene tye abiro, ma gin cwiny pa Lubanga abiro, ma en ocwalo iwi lobo ducu. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ci en ocito okwanyo buk adola woko ki itung cing ma lacuc pa ngat ma onongo obedo iwi komker ni. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ikare madong en okwanyo buk adola ni woko, ci lee makwo angwen ni ki ludongo pyere aryo wiye angwen ni guryebe piny inyim Latin romo, kun ngat acel acel ikin gi omako nanga, ki atabo jabu ma gupong ki odok eceta, ma en aye lega pa jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:3">Jab 33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:10">Ica 42:10</ref> </char></note> Ci gubedo ka wero wer manyen ma waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“In imyero me kwanyo buk adolani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ki me yabo lamwon ma kimwono kwedeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">pien yam kineki woko, dong ki remoni ilaro dano me dwokogi bot Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">lwak ma a ki i kaka mapol mapatpat, ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ileb ki rok mapatpat ducu,<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:6">Nia 19:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 16">Yub 16</ref> </char>
    </note> ilokogi gudoko lwak pa Lubanga ma en loyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">ma gin aye dong ajwaki ma gitiyo bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">gin bene gibiloyo lobo.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka dong aneno, ci awinyo dwon lumalaika ma welgi pe kwane, alip ki alip, ma gurumu komker woko, ki lee makwo ki ludongo, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />kun giloko ki dwon malongo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Latin romo ma kineko ni en aye ma myero</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">me nongo twero, lonyo, ryeko, teko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">woro, deyo kacel ki pwoc!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ka dok awinyo ginacweya ducu matye i polo, iwi lobo, ki piny ite lobo, ki ma gitye i nam gu ki gin ducu matye iye, ma giloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Pwoc ki woro, deyo ki twero obed nakanaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">bot en ma obedo iwi komker, ki bot Latin romo!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Ci lee makwo angwen ni gugamo ni, “Amen!” Ci ludongo guryebe piny guworo Lubanga ki Latin romo.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ginamwona abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Lacen aneno Latin romo oyabo kabedo acel kama onongo kimwono ki ikin abironi, ci awinyo lee acel ki ikin lee makwo angwen ca oloko ki dwon macalo mor pa kot ni, “Bin!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Jek 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:3">6:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref> </char></note> Ka dok aneno aguragura matar, ki ngat ma ngweco kwede onongo omako atum. Kimiye lalukana, ci en ocito woko kun loyo lweny, dok bene ni wek en obed ka loyo lweny.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ka dok en oyabo kama kimwono me aryone, ci awinyo lee makwo me aryone ka loko ni, “Bin!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Jek 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:2">6:2</ref> </char></note> Cutcut aguragura mukene makwar adada oa ki woko obino odonyo; ngat ma onongo ngweco kwede kimiye twer me kwanyo kuc woko ki iwi lobo, wek dano gubed ka neke keken gi, dok bene kimiye pala lucwan madit me lweny.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 6:2">Jek 6:2</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikare ma oyabo kama kimwono me adeke, ci awinyo lee makwo me adek ka loko ni, “Bin!” Cutcut atugi neno aguragura macol; onongo ngat ma ringo kwede omako mijan i cinge. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Lacen dok awinyo dwon ma oa ki ikin lee makwo angwen ni kun loko ni, “Ngano agwata acel wele denari acel, cayiri agwata adek wele denari acel ento moo jeituni ki kongo bwino pe ibalgi!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ikare ma dok en oyabo kama kimwono me angwene, ci awinyo lee makwo me angwene ka loko ni, “Bin!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Eje 14:21</ref></char></note> Ka dok aneno aguragura ma kome kibworo, ngat ma ngweco kwede onongo nyinge To, kun kabedo pa jo ma oto onongo lubu kore. Omiyogi twero ikom dul lobo acel me angwen me neko dano ki pala lucwan, ki kec, ki two gemo, ki lee tim mager.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ikare ma oyabo kama kimwono me abice, aneno tipu pa jo ma ginekogi pi lok pa Lubanga ki pi bedo caden me lok meno; aneno tipugi tye ite keno tyer. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Gukok ki dwon malongo ni, “Ai Rwot Matwero ducu, Rwot maleng ki me ada! Ibitero kare marom mene ma nongo peya ingolo kop, dok ma nongo peya iculu kwor me remowa ikom jo ma bedo i lobo?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ci kimiyo jor matar bot ngat acel acel, ka kicikogi ni pud kong dong guywe pi kare mo manoknok, nio wang ma wel lutic wadigi ki utmego ma kibinekogi calo gin ocobe kakare.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 11:13">Niy 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24">Mar 13:24</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21:25</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare ma en oyabo kama kimwono me abicele, aneno, ci nen, oyengyeng oyengo lobo matek tutwal, omiyo ceng ocido woko macol licuc calo bongo cola, ki dwe odoko kwar calo remo. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Ica 34:4</ref></char></note> Lakalatwe me polo guo woko piny ni ruburubu calo nyig yat oduru me cwir ma poto ki ijange ka yamo ma okodo matek oyengo. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:20">Niy 16:20</ref> </char></note> Ci polo bene orwenyo woko liweng calo karatac ma kidolo, kadi ki got ki cula nam kikobogi woko ducu ki ka kargi. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">Ica 2:19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 2:21">21</ref></char></note> Ka dong luker me lobo, ki jo ma pirgi dito, ki ludito me mony ducu, lulonyo ki wegi twero ki jo ducu ma iwi lobo, opii ki jo ma gilone ken gi, gukane woko i boro ki ikin got ma obar ma i godi ducu, <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Koc 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk 23:30</ref> </char></note> kun giwaco bot godi madongo ki godi matino ni, “Wupot ikomwa ci wuumwa woko ki iwang ngat ma obedo iwi komker, ki i akemo pa Latin romo; <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Joe 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref> </char></note> pien nino madit me akemogi dong oo, ci anga ma bitwero cung iye?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kiketo lanyut ikom jo Icrael 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:36">Jer 49:36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:5">Jek 6:5</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen ki inge man aneno lumalaika angwen gucung ibut lobo angwen ducu, ma gin gengo yamo me lobo woko, wek yamo mo pe okod i lobo, nyo i nam, kadi ki ikom yat mo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Dok aneno lamalaika mukene ma ito cito malo ki kama ceng tuc ki iye, onongo tye ki lanyut pa Lubanga makwo. Ci okok ki dwon malongo bot lumalaika angwen ma onongo kimiyogi twero me balo lobo ki nam. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eje 9:4</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref> </char></note> En owaco ni, “Pe wubal lobo nyo nam kadi ki yadi, nio wang madong waketo lanyut itur nyim lutic pa Lubangawa.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ka dok awinyo bene wel dano ma kiketo lanyut ikomgi, gubedo dano alip miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye angwen, ma gua ki i kaka pa jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ikaka pa Juda kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Reuben kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Gad kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Ikaka pa Acer kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Naputali kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Manace kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Ikaka pa Cimeon kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Levi kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Icakar kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Ikaka pa Jabulon kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Yucepu kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo. Ikaka pa Benjamin kiketo lanyut ikom dano alip apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak dano ma gua ki i rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Lacen ki inge man aneno lwak dano mapol ata, ma ngat mo pe romo kwano welgi, ma gua ki i rok ducu, ki i kaka ducu, ki dano ducu me wi lobo, ki leb ducu, ma gucung inyim komker ki inyim Latin romo, kun guruke ki jor matar, ma gumako jang otit i cinggi. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Gin gudange ki dwon malongo ni, “Laro dano tye bot Lubangawa ma obedo iwi komker, ki bot Latin romo!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Lumalaika ducu onongo gucung gurumu komker woko dyere, gurumu bene ludongo ki lee makwo angwen ni, ka guryebe piny inyim komker ci guworo Lubanga, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />kun giwaco ni, “Amen! Pak ki deyo, ryeko ki pwoc, woro, twero ki teko obed bot Lubangawa nakanaka. Amen.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ci ngat acel ki ikin ludongo oloko kweda, kun penya ni, “Jo magi ma guruku jor matar ni gin angagi, gua kono ki kwene?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar 13:19</ref></char></note> Adoke iye ni, “Ladit, in ingeyo.” En dok owaco bota ni, “Magi aye gin jo ma gua ki i can madit atika, gin bene dong gutyeko lwoko jorgi ki remo pa Latin romo odoko matar adada. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Pimeno, dong gitye inyim komker pa Lubanga, ma gitiyo bote i ode dyeceng ki dyewor; ngat ma obedo iwi komker bibedo ikin gi kun gwokogi. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Ica 49:10</ref></char></note> Kec pe dok binekogi, kadi orwo pii bene pe dok binekogi, ceng pe dok biwangogi, kadi kit lyeto mo bene. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Jab 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Eje 34:23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:2">Jab 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Ica 49:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ica 25:8</ref></char></note> Pien Latin romo matye i dye komker bibedo lakwatgi; en bitelogi terogi iwang it me pii me kwo, Lubanga bene bidunyo pig wanggi woko ducu ki i wanggi.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kama kimwono me abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ikare ma Latin romo oyabo kama kimwono me abiro ne ni, polo oling woko litik pi kare maromo nucu cawa kulu. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ci lacen aneno lumalaika abiro ma gin cung inyim Lubanga kare ki kare, kimiyo botgi tum abiro. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:1">Amo 9:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1">Nia 30:1</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 30:3">3</ref></char></note> Lamalaika mukene obino ci ocung inyim keno tyer, onongo omako atabo jabu me wango odok eceta. Kimiye odok eceta mabup wek omed ki lega pa jo pa Lubanga ducu ikom keno tyer jabu matye inyim komker. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Ci yito odok eceta ma giwango oa ki i cing lamalaika ma onongo tye inyim Lubanga, oduny kacel ki lega pa jo pa Lubanga ocito malo. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lev 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:2">Eje 10:2</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Nia 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Niy 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref></char></note> Lacen doki lamalaika okwanyo atabo me wango odok eceta, otoko lodi mac ki ikeno tyer pong atabo meno, ci obolo woko piny i lobo; cutcut kot ocako mor kun mwoc matek adada, ma nongo lutkot wil awila, ki oyengyeng bene yengo piny.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tum abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Cutcut lumalaika abiro ma onongo gitye ki tum abiro ni guyube dong me kutugi.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:23-25">Nia 9:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Eje 38:22</ref></char>
    </note> Ci lamalaika mukwongo okutu tume, omiyo pee ki mac ma orube ki remo ocore i lobo. Meno omiyo acel me adek me lobo owang woko, ki acel me adek me yadi bene, ki lum madyak ducu bene owang wok liweng.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Lamalaika me aryone okutu tume, ci gin mo ma onongo nen calo got madit tutwal, ma onongo mac tye ka wangone opoto woko i dye nam. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Cutcut dul acel me adek me nam odoko remo, acel me adek me gin makwo ducu ma gibedo i nam guto, ki acel me adek me mel ducu bene gunginye woko.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:12">Ica 14:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika me adeke okutu tume, ci lakalatwe madit oa ki i polo opoto piny, ma lyel calo mac dog raa, opoto ikom dul acel me adek me kulu ducu, ki iwang it ducu ma pii gi gunye agunya. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jer 9:15</ref></char></note> Nying lakalatwe meno Yat roka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yat man jo mukene lwongo ni Kicuk onyo Roki.</char></note> Dul acel me adek me pii odoko kec calo yat roka, pii meno oneko lwak dano mapol, pien onongo dong odoko kec.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ica 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref></char>
    </note> Lamalaika me angwene okutu tume, ci gin mo ogoyo dul acel me adek me ceng woko, ki dul acel me adek me dwe, ki dul acel me adek me lakalatwe, ma omiyo dulgi me acel me adeke odoko col; dero mo maryeny obedo pe pi dul acel me adek me dyeceng ki dul acel me adek me dyewor bene.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ka dok aneno, ki bene awinyo ocur mo tye kakoko ki dwon malongo, ikare ma onongo en tye ka tuk i dye yamo kun kok ni, “Can, can, can iwi jo ma bedo i lobo, pi dwon tum mukene ma pud gudong ma lumalaika adek ma pud odong dong gicok kutune!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Lamalaika me abice okutu tume, ci aneno lakalatwe oa ki i polo opoto woko i ngom, kun onongo kimiye layab me dog bur matut ma tere pe gik. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Aca 19:28</ref></char></note> En oyabo dog bur, ci yito oduny ki idoge calo yito ma oa ki iruk mac madit adada matye ikeno, ceng ki yamo gucido woko ki yito ma oa ki ibur. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Nia 10:12-15</ref></char></note> Lwak bonyo oa ki i yito meno omuke obino i lobo oumu woko lipuk. Bonyo magi kimiyo botgi kit twero marom ki twero ma oton me loboni tye kwede. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eje 9:4</ref></char></note> Kicikogi ni pe gubal lum me lobo, kadi gin ma twi atwiya, nyo yat mo, ento guket can ikom jo ma gin pe ki lanyut pa Lubanga itur nyimgi. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Pe ki ye ki gin ni gunek jo meno aneka, ento ki ye ki gin ni guun dano auna pi dwe abic. Arem ma giwinyo pi aun ma giunugi kwede onongo rom ki arem ma dano ma oton okayo bedo kwede. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Yub 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Jer 8:3</ref></char></note> Ikare meno dano biyenyo to, ento pe gibinongo; gibimitoni gito woko, ento to biringo woko ki botgi.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:4">Joe 2:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lwak bonyo ma omuke obino i lobo ni onongo gin nen calo lwak aguragura ma kiyubugi woko pi lweny; onongo bene tye gin mogo iwigi manen calo lalukana jabu; wanggi obedo calo wang dano, <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />yer wigi obedo calo yer wi mon, lakgi obedo calo lak labwor. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:5">Joe 2:5</ref></char></note> Korgi kiumu ki gin ma obedo calo nyonyo ma acikari gigengo ki korgi, ma nongo bwomgi ngur winye calo mor pa lwak gadigadi lweny ma lwak aguragura aye giywayo, kun gicito gilaro lweny. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Yibgi onongo tye obedo calo lwak oton, kwirgi bene tye me kayo dano, ki twerogi me unu dano pi dwe abic onongo bene yam tye i yibgi. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Laditgi ma onongo loyogi macalo rwot obedo lamalaika me bur matut ma tere pe gik. Nyinge i leb Ibru onongo kilwongo ni Abaddon; i leb Grik kilwongo ni Apollyon. (Te loke ni Labal piny).<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Can mukwongo dong okato. Winy ba! Can aryo mukene pud odong ma omyero obin.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Nia 30:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika me abicele okutu tume, ci awinyo dwon mo ma a ki i twok keno tyer angwen me jabu matye inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Owaco bot lamalaika me abicel matye ki tum ni, “Gony lumalaika angwen ma kitweyogi i dog kulu madit me Euprateni woko.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Cutcut kigonyo lumalaika angwen ca, kun onongo dong kiyubugi pi kare meno kikome, pi cawa meno, inino meno, i dwe nu me mwaka meno, wek gunek dul acel me adek pa dano ducu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Wel acikari me mony ma onongo gin ngweco ki aguragura onongo romo million miya aryo; onongo awinyo ka giwaco welgi.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Man aye kit ma lwak aguragura ki jo ma gin ngweco kwedgi gunen kwede bota iginanyuta: jo ma gingweco kwedgi onongo yam guruku nyonyo me gengo korgi ma rangigi kwar calo lodi mac, dok obedo bulu calo kidi capir, ki dok rangine obedo calo rangi lwit opok, macalo gweng calfa. Aguragura onongo wigi calo wi labwor, kun mac ki yito ki aluu me kidi calfa ma wang kati ki idoggi. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Acel me adek pa dano ducu gemo magi adek; mac, yito ki aluu me kidi calfa ma kati ki idog aguragura onekogi woko. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Pien twero pa lwak aguragura meno tye idoggi ki i yibgi. Yibgi obedo calo twol mapol matye ki wigi, en ki yibgi ni aye giketo kwede arem ikom dano.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Jab 115:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">135:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5:23</ref></char>
    </note> Jo mukene ma two gemo magi pe onekogi yam pe gungut pi gin ma onongo gin ki komgi gutiyo ki cinggi, pe guweko woro jogi, ki cal jogi ma gutiyo ki jabu, ki ryal ki mola, ki kidi me wel gu, ki yadi, ma gin cal jogi ma pe gitwero neno gin mo, dok pe gitwero winyo lok mo, kadi ki wot bene pe gitwero wot. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Jo meno yam bene pe gungut pi nek ma guneko ki dano, nyo pi timgi me jokjok, kadi pi timo tim tarwang, nyo pi kwalo kwo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Lamalaika ki buk adola matidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Dok aneno lamalaika mukene matek tutwal oa ki i polo kun lor bino piny. Oruke woko ki pol, ma onongo danyu tye iwiye, wange onongo obedo calo ceng, ki tyene onongo obedo calo wir mac. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Onongo buk adola matidi tye i cinge ma iye oyabe woko. Oketo tyene tung lacuc i nam ki tyene tung lacam oketo iwi lobo. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Odange ki dwon malongo calo labwor ma moro dwone. Ikare ma en odange, ci lutkot omwoc maromo tyen abiro kulu. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ma lutkot dong omwoc tyen abiro, ci ayube ka coc, cutcut acako winyo dwon ma a ki i polo kun waco ni, “Kan mung me lok ma lutkot abiro ni guwaco woko, pe i co piny.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Nia 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:40">Nwo 32:40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3:7</ref> </char></note> Ci lamalaika ma onongo aneno ocung i nam ki i loboni otingo cinge ma lacuc malo i polo, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ka okwongo kwong ki nying ngat ma bedo nakanaka, ma ocweyo polo ki jami ducu matye iye, ki lobo ki jami ducu matye iye, kacel ki nam ki jami ducu matye iye kun waco ni, “Agalagala mo dong peke, <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />ento ka kare oromo ma lamalaika me abiro bikutu tume, Lubanga bicobo tame matye i mung kit macalo yam otito bot lutice ma lunebi.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 2:8-3:3">Eje 2:8—3:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Doki awinyo ka dwon ma onongo oa ki i poloni tye kalok kweda tyen me aryo kun waco ni, “Cit ikwany buk adola ma oyabe matye i cing lamalaika ma ocung iwi nam ki i lobo ni.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ci acito bot lamalaika meno, atite ni omiya buk adola matidi ni; ci en ogamo owaca ni, “Gam icam woko. Bibedo kec i ii, ento bibedo lim i dogi calo moo kic.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Cutcut agamo buk adola matidi ni woko ki i cing lamalaika ci acamo woko. Obedo lim idoga calo moo kic, ento ikare madong atyeko camone, obedo makec i iya. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ka dong kiwaca ni, “In myero doki itit lok pa Lubanga, ikom lwak dano mapatpat ki rok ki leb ki luker ducu.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lucaden aryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Eje 40:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1">Jek 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 2:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen kimiya lagada me pimo piny, ma obedo calo odo, ci giwaca ni, “A icit ipim Ot pa Lubanga ki keno tyer, ci ikwan wel jo ma giworo Lubanga i ode. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21:24</ref> </char></note> Ento pe ipim dyekal ma woko me Ot pa Lubanga, pien dong kityeko miyone woko bot jo ma pe gingeyo Lubanga, gibibedo ka nyono gang maleng woko pi dwe pyere angwen wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Abimiyo twero bot lucadena aryoni me tito lok pi nino alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abicel, ma nongo guruku bongo cola.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Jek 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref></char>
    </note> Lucaden aryo ni gin aye yadi jeituni aryo ki lacib mac tara aryo ma gicung inyim Rwot me lobo. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Kace onongo ngat mo mito timogi rac, ci mac bicore i doggi wango lukworgi woko liweng; dong ka ngat mo ma mito timogi rac, meno aye kit ma kibineke kwede. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Luk 17:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-19">Nia 7:17-19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:8">1 Cam 4:8</ref></char></note> Gitye ki twero me gengo polo woko wek kot pe ocwer ikare ma nongo gitye katito lok pa Lubanga. Gitye bene ki twero me loko pii wek odok remo, dok me keto can ikom lobo i yo ducu, tyen mapol kit macalo cwinygi mito.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-7">Niy 13:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">17:8</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka dong gutyeko miyo cadengi, ci lee maca ma okati ki ibur ma tere pe giki biero lweny ikomgi, dok bene binekogi woko. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Ica 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 1:10">10</ref></char></note> Ci komgi mutoni birade i dye yoo me gang madit, ma i carolok kilwongo nyinge ni Codom, ki dok ni Ejipt, en bene kama yam giguro iye Rwotgi ikom yatariya. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Dano ma gua ki ikin lwak me wi lobo ki i kaka mapatpat ki leb gu ki i rok mapatpat gibineno komgi ma oto pi nino adek ki nucu, kun pe gibiyeni kiyikgi i lyel. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Jo ma bedo i lobo gibinyate ikomgi, gibibedo ki yomcwiny kun gicwalo mot ikin gi keken gi, pien lutit lok aryo meno onongo yam guunu dano ma bedo i lobo matek. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:10">Eje 37:10</ref></char></note> Ento inge nino adek ki nucu, yweyo me kwo oa ki bot Lubanga ci odonyo ikomgi, ka dong gucako a malo, gucungo ki tyen gi, ma omiyo lworo madit tutwal omako jo ducu ma onenogi. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Luk 2:11</ref></char></note> Cutcut guwinyo dwon malongo ma oa i polo kun waco ni, “Wuit wubin malo kany!” Ci guito i polo i pol, ma lukworgi bene gineno. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:12">Niy 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref></char></note> I cawa meno cutcut oyengyeng madit tutwal oyengo piny, ci dul acel me apar me taun madit meno omuke opoto woko piny. Oyengyeng meno oneko jo alip abiro, jo mudong lworo omakogi matek, ci gumiyo deyo bot Lubanga me polo.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Can me aryo dong okato. Nen, can me adek dong cok bino.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tum me abirone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:18">Nia 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7:14</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen lamalaika me abirone okutu tume, ci dwon mogo malongo owinye ki i polo ma waco ni, “Ker me lobo dong odoko ker pa Rwotwa kacel ki pa Kricitone, en dong bibedo kaloc matwal.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Cutcut ludongo pyere aryo wiye angwen ma gibedo iwi komkergi inyim Lubanga guryebe piny guworo Lubanga, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Wamiyo pwocwa boti, in Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">in ma itye dok mayam ibedo tye wa con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">pien dong imako tekoni madit ci icako loc.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:5">Jab 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:5">110:5</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:13">Jab 115:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lurok yam gubedo ki akemo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ci akemoni obino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ki kare me ngolo kop pa jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kare me miyo mot me pwoc bot lutici ma lutit loki, ki joni maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">bot jo ducu ma gilworo nyingi, jo me rwom ma piny ki jo me rwom mamalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ki kare me neno jo matye ka balo lobo woko.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 8:5">Niy 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:18">16:18</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 16:21">Niy 16:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka dong kiyabo Ot pa Lubanga matye i polo, ci Canduk me Gicike onen i Ot pa Lubanga. Kot ocako cwer kun lutkot wil, dok mwoc amwoca, ci dwon owinye malongo, piny omor, ci oyengyeng ocako yengo piny, ki pee bene ocore madwong tutwal.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Dako ki min kulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Lanyut mo madit adada onen i polo, dako mo ma onongo oruku ceng, kun dwe tye ite tyene, ki lalukana ma onongo en oruku iwiye obedo lakalatwe apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Dako nu onongo tye ki ic, ma onongo dong cok nywal; cutcut arem me nywal ogoyo en oweko omuke ki koko, kun pwode apwoda ki arem me nywal madong mito nywalo latin woko. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref> </char></note> Ci lanyut mo mukene dok onen i polo, min kulu mo makwar madit otuc, ma onongo wiye tye abiro, ki tunge tye apar, kun onongo lalukana abiro me loc tye iwiye ducu. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Yibe opwodo dul acel me adek pa lakalatwe me polo, ci ocorogi woko piny i ngom. Ka dong min kulu madit ca ocako cung inyim dako ma onongo mito nywal ca, wek ka dakonu onywal, ci emwony latine woko. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Ica 66:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Jab 2:9</ref> </char></note> Ci dakonu cut onywalo latin awobi, en ngat ma biloyo rok ducu ki odo nyonyo. Ento latin meno kigamo woko, kitero bot Lubanga ki i komkere. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Ci dakonu oa oringo woko i dye tim, kama Lubanga oyubu iye kabedo pire, kama ki bibedo ka pite iye pi nino alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abicel.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:9">Jud 9</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikare meno cutcut lweny ocake iwi polo, Mikael kacel ki lumalaikane gulwenyo ikom min kulu madit ti. Min kulu maditi kacel ki lumalaikane bene gulwenyo, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ento kiloyogi woko, ma omiyo kabedo dong odoko pe pirgi iwi polo. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Aca 3:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:18">Luk 10:18</ref> </char></note> Ci kibolo min kulu madit ca woko piny i ngom, mayam obedo min kulu macon ca, ma kilwongo ni Ladot, ki Catan, ma bwolo dano ma iwi lobo ducu; kibole woko piny i ngom kacel ki lumalaikane. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:9-11">Yub 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1">Jek 3:1</ref></char></note> Cutcut awinyo dwon mo malongo i polo ma waco ni, “Kombedi dong laro dano, ki teko, ki ker pa Lubangawa ki twero pa Kricito dong oo, pien ngat mayam doto utmegiwani dong gibolo woko piny i ngom, en ngat mayam dotogi inyim Lubangawa dyeceng ki dyeworni. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Gin dong guloye woko pi remo pa Latin romo, ki pi lok me caden ma gubedo ka tucune, dok bene pe guparo pi kwogi, ento gumine ken gi kadi wa i to. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Bed ki yomcwiny, in polo, ki wun bene ma wubedo iye! Ento wun lobo ki nam, wubineno can malit atika, pien Ladot dong olor obino woko piny botwu matye ki akemo madwong, pien ngeyo ni karene tye manok!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ikare ma min kulu dong onenoni kibole woko piny i ngom, ci ocako ryemo dako ca ma onongo onywalo latin awobini. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12:7</ref> </char></note> Ento kimiyo bwom ocur madito aryo bot dakonu, wek oa woko ki inyim min kulu, otuk ocit woko i dye tim, i kabedone kunu kama gibipite iye pi mwaka adek ki nucu. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ci min kulu ongoko pii ki idoge i kor dakonu, piine obedo calo pii me kulu, wek pii opong omol dakonu woko. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ento lobo okonyo dakonu, lobo ongamo doge ci omwonyo kulu meno ma onongo min kulu ongoko woko ki i dogeni. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Kiniga omako min kulu ikom dakonu, ci ocito oero lweny ikom likwayo pa dako ca mukeneni ducu ki, ikom jo ma gilubu cik pa Lubanga, ma gimako bene lok me caden ma Yecu omiyo. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Ka dong ocung ikweyo me dog nam.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lee aryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:3">Dan 7:3</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:3">Niy 17:3</ref>,<ref loc="REV 17:7-12">7-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok aneno lee mo ma oa ki i nam tye ka kati woko. Tunge tye apar ki wiye bene onongo tye abiro, kun onongo lalukana apar me loc tye itunge ducu; dok iwiye acel acel ducu onongo tye iye nying mo ma nyutu cac ikom Lubanga. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:4-6">Dan 7:4-6</ref> </char></note> Lee ma anenoni onongo obedo calo kwac, tyene obedo calo tyen nguu mager, ki doge onongo obedo calo dog labwor. Min kulu madit ca omiyo tekone, komkere, ki twero madit ma en tye kwede bot lee meno. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Aneno wiye acel onongo nen calo kigoyo kiketo ret iye ma ki mito nekone woko, ento ret meno ma onongo kiketo iwiye ni dong ocang woko. Lobo ducu olubu leenu ki ur madit ma pe wace. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Dano gubedo ka woro min kulu ca pien onongo omiyo twerone woko bot leenu, dok bene guworo leenu kun giwaco ni, “Anga ma obedo calo lee man, dok anga matwero lweny kwede?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7:8</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11:36</ref> </char>
    </note> Kimiyo twero bene bot leenu me loko lok mogo me wake ki me yeto Lubanga, dok bene kimiye twero me tiyo gin ma iye mito pi dwe pyere angwen wiye aryo. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Ci ongamo doge me yeto Lubanga, kun yeto nyinge ki kama en bedo iye, kun yeto bene wa jo ducu ma gibedo i polo. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref> </char></note> Dok bene kimiye twero me ero lweny ikom jo maleng ki tayogi woko. Kimiye bene twero me loyo kaka ducu, dano ducu ki lebgu, wa rok mapatpat ducu. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Jab 69:28</ref> </char></note> Jo ducu ma gibedo i lobo gibiworo leenu, gin jo ma nyingi yam pe kicoyo i buk me kwo pa Latin romo mayam kineko ca, cake wa i acaki piny. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Ka ngat mo ite tye myero owiny lok man. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jer 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 43:11">43:11</ref> </char></note> Kace onongo yam kiyubu ni kimak dano mo me bedo opii, ci kibitere woko i opii; kace ngat mo neko dano ki pala lucwan, en bene myero kineke woko ki pala lucwan. Meno aye kama jo pa Lubanga myero gunyut iye kit ma giciro kwede can ki niyegi.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Lacen dok aneno lee mukene ka kati ki i ngom; onongo tunge tye aryo calo tung latin romo kun loko calo min kulu. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />En otiyo ki twero pa lee mukwongo ca ducu dok en lee man, omiyo lobo kacel ki jo ducu ma gibedo iye woro lee mukwongo ca, ma ret ma iwiye onongo dong ocang wokoni. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />En otiyo tic mogo madito ma bedo me aura tutwal, dok bene miyo mac a ki i polo bino piny i lobo ma dano bene gineno. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Pi tic mogo ma onongo kiyene me tiyone inyim lee mukwongo ca, omiyo en obwolo dano ma gibedo i lobo. En owaco botgini guyub cal mo obed ma kaka lee ma onongo yam kiketo ret ikome ki pala lucwan, ma pud onongo obedo kwoni. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Kiyene bene me miyo yweyo i cal lee ma kiyubu ca wek omii cal leenu olok lok, dok bene wek omii jo ma pe gibiworo cal leenu kinekgi woko. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Dok bene en omiyo giketo poyo ikom dano ducu, jo ma rwomgi piny ki jo ma rwomgi malo, lulonyo ki lucan, jo ma gilone ken gi wa ki opii bene, i cinggi tung lacuc nyo itur nyimgi. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kitimo man wek dano mo pe owil jami, nyo kadi ki catone, ka pe tye ki lanyut meno ikome, ma meno obedo nying lee ca, nyo namba me nyinge. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Gin man mito ryeko. Ngat ma niang, ma wiye tiyo twero kwano namba pa leenu, pien nambane obedo namba pa dano, nambane tye miya abicel ki pyere abicel wiye abicel.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Latin romo ki jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eje 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:3">Niy 7:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Lacen dok aneno Latin romo ma ocung iwi got Cion; onongo jo alip miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye angwen tye kacel kwede, madong onongo kicoyo nyinge ki nying Wone woko itur nyimgi. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Ci awinyo dwon mo oa ki i polo mamor calo pii matye ka cure, ki dok calo kot matye kamor matek. Dwon ma awinyo ca onongo obedo calo dwon lugo nanga matye ka goyo nangagi. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Onongo gitye ka wero wer manyen inyim komker, ki inyim lee makwo angwen ni, ki inyim ludongogu bene. Pe tye ngat mo ma onongo twero pwonyo wer meno, kono jo alip miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye angwen ca keken madong kikokogi woko ki i lobo. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Magi aye gin jo ma pe gubalo komgi ki timo tim tarwang ki mon, pien gugwoke gubedo jo maleng; dok bene gin jo ma lubu Latin romo kama en woto iye ducu. Jo magi aye gin jo ma kikokogi ki ikin dano ducu, wek gubed calo cam mukwongo cek ma giyubu pi Lubanga ki Latin romo. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Jep 3:13</ref></char></note> Pe ki winyo lok goba mo idoggi; gubedo labongo roc mo ikomgi.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lumalaika adek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Dok aneno lamalaika mukene tye ka tuk wire i dye polo; onongo tye ki lok me Kwena Maber ma labed naka me atita bot jo ma gibedo iwi lobo, bot rok ducu ki kaka ki leb gu ki jo mapatpat ducu. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Ci oloko ki dwon malongo ni, “Wulwor Lubanga, wumii deyo bote, pien karene me ngolo kop dong oromo. Wuwor en ngat ma oketo polo ki lobo ki nam ki wang it gu.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 21:9">Ica 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">Jer 51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Niy 18:2</ref></char>
    </note> Lamalaika mukene me aryone dok olubu kor lawote, kun waco ni, “Babilon madit dong opoto, opoto gire woko, en gang mayam omiyo rok ducu mato kongo bwino me time me tarwangngi.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Lamalaika mukene me adeke dok olubu korgi, kun loko ki dwon malongo ni, “Kace ngat mo oworo lee nu ki calle, ma nongo giketo poyo itur nyime nyo i cinge, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Ica 51:17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Eje 38:22</ref> </char></note> ci en bimato kongo bwino me akemo pa Lubanga, ma oonyo i kikopo me kinigane ma pe girubu ki pii, gibibedo ka une ki mac ki gweng calfa ma mac oliyo woko, inyim lumalaika maleng ki inyim Latin romo bene. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Ica 34:10</ref> </char></note> Yito mac ma kiunugi kwede bedo ka duny nakanaka cito malo, kun pe giywe i dyeceng wa idyewor bene, gin jo ma giworo leenu ki calle, kadi wa ngat madong kiketo poyo me nying lee meno ikome.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Meno aye kama jo pa Lubanga myero gunyut iye kit ma giciro kwede can, gin jo ma gwoko cik pa Lubanga ki niyegi ikom Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Dok awinyo dwon mo oa ki ipolo ma waco ni, “Co lok man ni: cake kombedi jo ma to ma nongo gitye i Rwot tye ki gum.” Cwiny Maleng bene omoko lok man kun waco ni, “Adada kitmeno, dong gibiywe ki i tic matek mayam gubedo katiyone, pien ticgi mayam gutiyo ni lubu korgi.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kayo kac me lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen doki aneno pol matar, ki ngat mo obedo iwi pol ma cal ki wod pa dano. Lalukana jabu onongo tye iwiye, ki pala kac mabit bene onongo tye i cinge. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3:13</ref></char></note> Ka dok lamalaika mukene okati ki i Ot pa Lubanga, kun dange matek bot ngat ma onongo obedo iwi pol ni, “Cwal cingi i kaa kac ki pala kaci, pien kare me kac dong oromo, ki gin ma kikayo i lobo bene dong ocek woko.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Kitmeno ngat ma onongo obedo iwi pol oryeyo cinge i lobo ki pala kac, ci okayo gin ma ocek i lobo.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Lamalaika mukene doki okati ki i Ot pa Lubanga matye i polo, en bene onongo omako pala kac mabit. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Lamalaika mukene dok oa ki inget keno tyer obino; lamalaika meno onongo tye ki twero ikom mac. Ci odange matek bot ngat ma onongo tye ki pala kac mabit ca ni, “Cwal cingi ki pala kaci ci icok nyig olok me lobo, pien nyige dong ocek woko.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Kitmeno lamalaika oryeyo cinge i lobo ki pala kac, ci ocoko olok ducu me lobo, oonyo woko ibur madit me biyo pig olok me akemo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Ica 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:15">Kok 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Niy 19:15</ref></char></note> Ci kinyono bur me biyo olok meno woko inge gang, remo omol ki ibur me biyo olok, ma bore romo mairo miya aryo, ki tute piny onongo mito romo cokcok puti abic.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lumalaika gukelo gemo me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Aneno dok i ginanyuta mo mukene madit i polo, ma obedo bene gin me aura mada, en aye lumalaika abiro ma gitye ki gemo abiro. Magi gin aye dong gemo me agikine, pien gin aye gimiyo akemo pa Lubanga cobe kakare.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ka dok aneno gin mo manen calo nam me kiyo maleng ma orube ki mac; dong jo ma onongo gutayo lee ca ki cale, ki namba me nyinge, onongo gucung i dog nam me kiyo, kun gumako nanga pa Lubanga i cinggi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Nia 15:1</ref></char></note> Onongo gitye kawero wer pa Moses, ma obedo latic pa Lubanga, ki wer pa Latin romo kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Tici ducu ma itiyo bedo me aura, dok gidito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ai Rwot Lubanga Won Twer Ducu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Kiti ducu tye atir dok me ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">in Rwot ma iloyo rok ducu!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 10:7">Jer 10:7</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Jab 86:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Anga mono ma pe bilwori, Ai Rwot?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Anga kono ma pe bipako nyingi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Pien in keni aye ileng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Rok ducu gibino o wa inyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">gin ducu gibiwori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">pien tici ducu ma atir otyeko nen kamaleng.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 38:21">Nia 38:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen anen Ot pa Lubanga, ma en Kema me lok me Caden matye i polo oyabe woko. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ci lumalaika abiro gua ki i Ot pa Lubanga gukati woko ki gemo abiro. Onongo guruku bongo matar maleng adada, ma gutweyo korgi woko ki del jabu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ci lee acel ki ikin lee makwo angwen ca omiyo atabo jabu abiro bot lumalaika abiro; kun onongo atabo magi gupong woko ki kiniga pa Lubanga ma bedo kwo nakanaka. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Nia 40:34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10">1 Luk 8:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 8:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Tek 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 5:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Ica 6:4</ref> </char></note> Yito ma oa ki ideyo pa Lubanga ki tekone omwono Ot pa Lubanga woko limuk, ma ngat mo onongo pe twero donyo iye, nio wang ma gemo abiro ma lumalaika abiro gukelo ca dong otum woko liweng.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Atabo me akemo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Dok awinyo dwon mo malongo ma oa ki i Ot pa Lubanga kun waco bot lumalaika abiro ni, “Wucit wuony akemo pa Lubanga matye i atabo abiro ca ni woko i lobo.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:10">Nia 9:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika mukwongo ocito oonyo gin ma i atabone woko i lobo. Ci two bur maracu ma toko kom dano atoka omako jo ma lanyut pa lee ca tye ikomgi ma giworo cale beneni.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Lamalaika me aryone oonyo gin ma i atabone woko i nam, ci oloke odoko calo remo pa dano ma oto, ki gin makwo ducu ma onongo gitye i nam guto woko.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Nia 7:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:44">Jab 78:44</ref></char>
    </note> Lamalaika me adeke oonyo gin ma i atabone i kulu ki iwang it gu ducu ci gin ducu guloke gudoko remo. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Cutcut awinyo lamalaika maloyo pii ka waco ni, “Kop ma ingolo ni ingolo giri atir, in ngat matye, yam bene ibedo tye con, in Ngat Maleng. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Pien jo ma guoyo remo pa joni maleng, ki remo pa lutit loki, in bene imiyo botgi remo me amatagi. Can ma imiyogi oporo kakare pi gin ma gutimo.” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Dok awinyo dwon ma a ki i keno tyer ka dange ni, “Ada, Rwot Lubanga Won Twer Ducu, kop ducu ma ingolo bedo ada dok atir!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Lamalaika me angwene oonyo gin ma i atabone woko ikom ceng, dok bene kiye ni owang dano woko ki lyeto mager me ceng marom ki lyeto mac. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Lyeto mager tutwal owango dano atika, ma omiyo dano guyeto nying Lubanga matye ki twero ikom gemo magi, pe gungut dok bene pe gumiyo deyo bote.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:21">Nia 10:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika me abic oonyo gin ma i atabone woko ikom komker pa lee ca, ci kere dong ocako bedo i colpiny; pi arem madwong omiyo dano gukayo lebgi ma pe wace. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Gin oyeto Lubanga me polo pi arem ki bur ma otoko komgi woko, dok bene pe gungut ikom tim maracu ma gutimo.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:15">Ica 11:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika me abicele oonyo gin ma i atabone woko i kulu madit Euprate, ci piine otwo woko pi yubu yoo pi wot pa luker ma gia ki tung kunyango. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Lacen aneno cen adek ma gubedo calo ogwal ma okati ki idong min kulu, ki i dog lee, ki i dog lanebi ma lagoba. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Gin gubedo cen pa jok ma tiyo tic mogo me aura tutwal. Ma bene giwoto bot luker me wi lobo ducu ka cokogi woko kacel pi mony inino madit pa Lubanga Won Twer Ducu. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk 12:39</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">Niy 3:3</ref></char></note> (<char style="wj">Nen, abibino macalo lakwo! Dano ma bedo ma wange twolo kun kiyo piny tye ki gum, ma kun nongo gwoko bongine, wek pe ewot munero, ma dano gineno kome ma pe eruku iye bongo!</char>) <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:29">2 Luk 23:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Jek 12:11</ref></char></note> Gucoko luker kacel i kabedo ma kilwongo i leb Ibru ni Armagedon.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Lamalaika me abirone dong oonyo gin matye i atabone i dye yamo, ci dwon mo madit oa ki i Ot pa Lubanga, ki iwi komker kun waco ni, “Dong otime!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Niy 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:13">11:13</ref>,<ref loc="REV 11:19">19</ref></char></note> Ci lutkot ocako wil awila, dok mor winye matek, ki mwoc pa kot, ki oyengyeng madit oyengo piny, kit oyengyeng mo ma peya yam onen nicake ma dano gubedo i lobo; oyengyeng meno obedo dit adada. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Ica 51:17</ref></char></note> Oweko taun maditi obare opoke dul adek, taun madito pa lurok ducu gumuk gupoto woko piny. Ci Lubanga opo pi Babilon ma en taun madit, pi miye ni omat kongo bwino ikikopo me akemone mager. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:14">Niy 6:14</ref></char></note> Ma omiyo cula nam ducu gurwenyo woko, ki godi ducu bene dong gurwenyo woko ma pe dong giromo nongogi. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Nia 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Niy 11:19</ref></char></note> Pee mapek tutwal ocore ki i polo opoto ikom dano, kun pek pa nyig pee acel acel onongo cokcok romo kilogram pyere abic. Man oweko dano guyeto Lubanga pi gemo man me pee ni, pien gemo meno onongo obedo rac ma okato kare.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dako ma lakwele marac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:13">Jer 51:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen lamalaika acel ikom lumalaika abiro ma onongo gitye ki atabo abironi obino bota owaca ni, “Bin wek anyuti kop madong kingolo ikom dako ma lakwele marac, ma en aye taun madit ma kigero i dog nam mapoli. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Ica 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51:7</ref></char></note> Luker me wi lobo ducu gutimo kwede tim me kwelekwele, kadi wa jo ma bedo i lobo bene gumer ki kongo bwino me tim me kweleneni.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:1">Niy 13:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cutcut lamalaika otinga otera i tim, kun onongo Cwiny Maleng oyutu tama woko, ci aneno dako mo ma obedo iwi lee mo makwar, ma kicoyo nying mogo ikom leenu ma nyutu cac ikom Lubanga; coc meno oromo kome ducu. Leenu onongo wiye tye abiro ki tunge tye apar. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51:7</ref> </char></note> Dako meno oruku bongo ma obedo lamarlamar ki makwar, ma odeyo kome ki jabu, ki kidi me wel, ki tiko matar me welgu, kun omako kikopo jabu i cinge ma opong woko ki gin ma dano kwero, ki cilo me time me kweleni. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Itur nyime kicoyo iye nying mo ma teloke obedo me mung ni, “Babilon madit, megi mon ducu ma gin malaya, ki jo ducu ma gitimo tim me kwer.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Aneno dako meno omer woko ki remo pa jo pa Lubanga, dok bene ki remo pa lucaden pa Yecu ma ginekogi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ka dong anene ci abedo ki ur madit tutwal. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ento lamalaika openya ni, “Pingo iuru? Abititti lok me mung pa dakonu, ki pa lee ma dako meno obedo iwiye, ma wiye tye abiro ki tunge tye aparni. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">Niy 11:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Jab 69:28</ref></char></note> Lee ma inenoni onongo yam tye, ento kombedi dong pe. En dong tye kabino malo kun a ki ibur ma tere pe gik, dok kibityeke woko matwal. Dong jo ma bedo i lobo mayam pe kicoyo nyinggi i buk me kwo cake i acaki piny gibiuru mada me neno lee meno pien yam con tye, kombedi dong pe, ento ceng mo dok binen. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Lok man mito tam ki ryeko. Wiye abironu obedo godi matino abiro ma dako ca obedo iye. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Gin bene gubedo luker abiro ma jo abic ki ikomgi dong gupoto woko, acel pud tye kaloc, ento acel mukene peya obino. Ka obino, myero kong orii pi kare mo manok keken. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Ento lee mayam tye ca, ma kombedi dong pe ni, en aye rwot me aborone, ento en ngat acel ikin jo abiro ca, dok bicito woko ci kibityeke woko. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dan 7:24</ref> </char></note> Dong tung lee apar ma ineno ca gin aye luker apar ma peya gulimo twero me loc, ento myero gulim twero me loc macalo luker pi cawa acel, kacel ki lee ca. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Luker apar magi onongo yam tamgi tye acel, ci gumiyo twerogi ki ditogi woko bot lee ca. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Jonu biero mony ikom Latin romo, ento Latin romo bitayogi woko, pien en Rwot pa rwodi, ki Rwot maloyo luker ducu, dok jo matye bote aye jo ma kilwongogi, ma kiyerogi ma gin jo ma gene.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Lamalaika dok owaca ni, “Pii madwong ma i kulu ma ineno ca, kama dako ma lakwele obedo iye ni, magi aye gin dano ma iwi lobo, ki lwak rok ducu ki leb gu ducu. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Dong tung lee apar ma ineno ca, gin kacel ki lee gibikwero dakonu ma lakwele ni woko; gibitenye ata kun giweke dong munero, gibicamo ringo kome ci giwango woko ki mac. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Pien Lubanga aye ma oketo miti man i cwinygi, wek gucob tame kun gibedo ki cwiny acel, ka wek dong gumi twerogi bot lee ca, nio wang ma lok ma Lubanga owaco ocobe kakare. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Dako ma ineno ca en aye taun madit matye ka loyo luker ducu me wi lobo.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Poto pa Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Lacen dok aneno lamalaika mukene ka lor bino piny kun a ki ipolo, ma onongo tye ki twero madit; deyone oryeny ocaro wi lobo ducu. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Ica 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">Jer 51:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Niy 14:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:21">Ica 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:39">Jer 50:39</ref> </char></note> Ci odange ma dwone winye matek tutwal ni, “Babilon madit dong opoto, opoto gire woko! Dong odoko kabedo pa jogi, odoko bene ka kane pa cen ducu, ki pa winyo maracu ma idano kwero. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Ica 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51:7</ref></char></note> Rok ducu gumato kongo bwino me time macol me tarwangeni, luker ducu me wi lobo gutimo kwede abor, ki lucat wil ma iwi lobo ducu dong gumede gudoko lulonyo pi bedone me caro ki tim tarwangeni madong okato kakare.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Ica 48:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Jer 50:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:6">51:6</ref>,<ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref></char>
    </note> Dok awinyo dwon mukene ma oa ki i polo kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Wun jona, wua woko ki bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">wek pe wuribe kwede i bale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">wek bene pe wunywak kwede gemo mogo ma poto ikome!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20">Aca 18:20</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">Jer 51:9</ref></char>
    </note> Pien bale dong odure malo lipim, oo wa i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:5">Lubanga dong opo ikom tim maracu ducu mayam en otimo.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 137:8">Jab 137:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Jer 50:29</ref> </char>
    </note> Wutim dakonu ki kit tim mayam en otimowu kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">wucul kwor ikome madodo time ma en otime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">wurub ire ginamata makece kato i kikopone makato mayam en omiyowu woko.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Ica 47:7-9</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok wumii bote arem ki kumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">marom ki kit ma en obedo ka wake kwede ki kwone me kuc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Pien en waco ki i cwinye ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘An daker, abedo iwi komker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">An pe dato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">pe abibedo ki kumu mo wa ki acel!’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Pimeno, gemone ducu bipoto ikome inino acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">two odeke, kumu ki kec.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kibiwange woko bene ki mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">pien Rwot Lubanga ma ngolo kop ikome teke dit.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Dong luker me wi lobo mayam gutimo abor kwede, ma gulubu time me tarwang, gibikok pire kun gidongo oduru ma nongo ginene dong tye ka wang imac kun yitone duny. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16">Eje 26:16</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 26:17">17</ref></char></note> Gibicung wa cen pi lworo kit can ma giune kwede, kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Ai do, ai do! Ineno can ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">in Babilon, taun madit dok matek!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Kop ma kingolo ikomi dong opoto ikomi i cawa acel keken.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:31">Eje 27:31</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 27:36">36</ref></char>
    </note> Lucat wil me lobo bene gitye kakoko kun gikumu pire, pien ngat mo peke ma dok biwilo jami ma opong i melgi; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12">Eje 27:12</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 27:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 27:22">22</ref> </char></note> jabu, ryal, lutino kidi me wel, tiko matar me wel, bongo camanini ma bere, bongi ma obedo lamarlamar, bongi aridi ki makwar, ki kit bao mapatpat ducu ma wel, jami ducu ma kitiyo ki lak lyecgu, jami ducu ma kitiyogi ki bao ma welgi malo tutwal, nyonyo bronze, nyonyo iron, ki got marble maber tutwal, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />cinamon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yat Cinamon nonge i lobo Acia mapol. Ki Uganda kany nonge i lobo pa Luloka. Gin lwongo ni Budalasini. Pok ngeye kitiyo kwede wek dek obed makur.</char></note> ki gin mogo mukene ma ngwecgi kur, odok eceta me awanga, murra, odok luban, kongo bwino, moo jeituni, moko mapwot ki ngano, dyangi ki romi, aguragura, ki gadigadi lweny, opii, kadi wa kwo pa dano kikome. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Lucat wil guwaco bote ni, “Jami mabeco mayam cwinyi paro tutwali dong kikwanyo woko ki boti, lonyoni ki deyoni ducu dong gurwenyo woko ki boti, pe dok ibinongogi matwal!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Eje 27:31</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 27:36">36</ref></char></note> Lucat wil mayam gicato jami magi ducu, madong gudoko lulonyo i taun madit meno, gibicung wa cen kamabor pi lworo can ma kiune kwede. Gibikok matek ma gikumu kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />“Ai do, ai do, taun madit man dong oneno can ba, en taun madit mayam onongo kiruku woko ki bongo camanini mabere, ki bongi ma lamarlamar ki makwar, kun kideyo woko ki jabu, kidi me wel, ki tiko matar me wel bene. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:14">Ica 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:26-30">Eje 27:26-30</ref></char></note> Lonyo madit kit man dong kiketo woko tengteng i cawa acel keken.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Ludito me mel, ki jo ma woto i nam, lukwang mel ki jo ducu ma gitiyo tic me cato wil i nam, gucung wa cen kamabor. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:32">Eje 27:32</ref></char></note> Gudange matek ka gunene tye ka wang kun yito duny, kun giwaco ni, “Gang mene ma onongo yam rom ki gang man maditi?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30-34">Eje 27:30-34</ref></char></note> Ci guonyo putu iwigi, ikare ma gitye kakoko kun gikumu ma gidange ki koko matek pire ni, “Ai do, ai do, ineno can ba, in gang maditi, kama jo ducu mayam gitye ki melgi i nam gudoko lulonyo pi lonyone madwongi! Kiketo woko tengteng i cawa acel keken. <verse eid="REV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nwo 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:48">Jer 51:48</ref> </char></note> Wudange ki wer me yomcwiny, wun lwak me polo, wun jo maleng, wun lukwena ki lutit lok pa Lubanga, pien Lubanga dong odwoko kop mayam ongolo i komwuni ikome!”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:63">Jer 51:63</ref>,<ref loc="JER 51:64">64</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:21">Eje 26:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lamalaika mo matek otugi kwanyo gweng mo madit marom ki kidi rego, ci obolo woko i nam, kun waco ni, “Babilon ma en taun maditi kibitimo ki tim bwami kibicanyo woko matek i ngom, pe dong kibinongo matwal! <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:13">Eje 26:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:8">Ica 24:8</ref></char></note> Dwon lugo nanga ki jo ma goyo wer ducu,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:10">25:10</ref></char></note> dwon lukut nyamulere ki lukut tum pe dok biwinye boti matwal. Dano mo ma tiyo tic me diro pe dok binonge boti matwal. Mor pa kidi rego pe dok biwinye boti matwal. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Tara mo pe dok bilyel menyi, kadi dwon lanyom ki dwon nyako ger pe dok biwinye boti matwal; pien lucatwili onongo yam gin jo ma pirgi dito atika i lobo, yam bene ibwolo rok ducu ki tim jokjok ma ibedo katimone. <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:49">Jer 51:49</ref></char></note> Remo pa lutit lok pa Lubanga ki pa jo maleng, ki remo pa jo ducu mayam kinekogi i lobo, kinongo tye i Babilon.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Lacen i nge man awinyo woo madwong macalo dwon lwak dano mapol ata ma gin tye i polo ma giwaco ni, “Aleluya! Laro dano ki deyo ki teko tye bot Lubangawa, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nwo 32:43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:7">2 Luk 9:7</ref></char></note> pien kop ma en ngolo ducu tye ada dok atir. En dong ongolo kop woko ikom dako ma malayani, mayam obalo lobo woko ki time me aborni, dok bene oculu kwor me remo pa lutice ikome.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Ica 34:10</ref></char></note> Gin dok gudange tyen me aryone kun giwaco ni, “Aleluya! Yito me wango taun madit man duny ma ocido cito malo litu nakanaka.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Ci ludongo pyere aryo wiye angwen kacel ki lee makwo angwen guryebe woko piny guworo Lubanga ma obedo iwi komkeri, kun giwaco ni, “Amen. Aleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me nyom pa Latin romo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:13">Jab 115:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dwon mo dok oa ki iwi komker ma waco ni, “Wupak Lubanga, wun lutice ducu, wun jo ma wulwore, jo matino wa ki jo madito.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Eje 1:24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 93:1">Jab 93:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:1">97:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99:1</ref></char></note> Ka dok awinyo dwon mo ma winye calo lwak mapol adada ma giwoo, calo mor pa pii ma core, dok calo mor kot ma mwoc matek. Kun giwaco ni, “Aleluya! Pien Rwot Lubangawa Won Twer Ducu, tye kaloc. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Wabedu ki yomcwiny, kun wadwore, dok bene wamii deyo bote, pien kare me nyom pa Latin romo dong oo, nyako gere bene dong oyube woko; <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />gimiyo bongo camanini mabere maryeny dok maleng en aye ni en oruki.” Pien bongo camanini maberenu obedo gin ducu matye atir ma jo maleng gitimo.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:2">Mat 22:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 22:3">3</ref></char>
    </note> Ci lamalaika owaca ni, “Coo lok man ni: Jo ma kilwongogi ikarama pa Latin romo tye ki gum.” Dok owaca ni, “Lok magi lok pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Cutcut aryebe woko piny katyene ka wore, ento en owaca ni, “Pe myero i tim kitmeno! An bene latic wadiwu, dok arom ki utmegini ma gumako lok me caden ma Yecu omiyo botgini. Wor Lubanga.” Pien lok me caden ma Yecu omiyo aye cwiny mamiyo lutit lok gitito lok pa Lubanga.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngat ma ringo ki aguragura matar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 1:1">Eje 1:1</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Jab 96:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Ica 11:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Lacen aneno polo oyabe, ci cutcut atugi neno aguragura matar! Ngat ma obedo iwiye kilwongo ni ngat ma Gene dok Ada; gin ma en timo ducu tye atir ingolo kop kadi wa ilweny bene. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref></char></note> Wange ryeny calo mac, dok onongo oruku lalukana mapol me loc iwiye; onongo bene tye ki nying mo ma kigoro ma ngat mo pe ngeyo, kono en keken gire aye ngeyo. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Bongo ma en oruku onongo kilutu i remo, dok nying ma onongo kilwonge kwede en aye “Lok pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Lwak mony mapol me polo ma guruku bongo camanini mabere, matar dok maleng, gulubu kore ma giringo ki aguragura matar. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Jab 2:9</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Ica 63:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:20">Niy 14:20</ref> </char></note> Pala lucwan mabit okati ki idoge, ma en bineko ki lurok woko ducu, ka dong bibedo ka loyogi ki odo nyonyo; en binyono bur me biyo kongo bwino me akemo pa Lubanga mager ma en Won Twer Ducuni. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Onongo kicoyo nying ikom jore ki i eme ma kwane ni, “Rwot maloyo luker ducu ki Rwot pa rwodi.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Eje 39:17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka dok aneno lamalaika mo ocung iceng. En olwongo kwayi winyi ducu mapatpat ma gituk i i dye yamo ki dwon malongo ni, “Wubin, wugure kacel kacamo cam me otyeno ma Lubanga oyubu, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />kacamo ringo kom luker, ki ringo kom ludito wi mony, ki ringo kom jo mayam gin oteka, ringo aguragura ki ringo kom jo ma ngweco kwedgi, ki ringo dano ducu, jo ma gilone ken gi kacel ki opii, jo me rwom mapiny ki jo me rwom mamalo ducu.” <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Lacen aneno lee ca ki luker me lobo guywayo monygi me lweny ikom ngat ma obedo iwi aguragura kacel ki monye. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1-18">Niy 13:1-18</ref> </char></note>Ento kimako lee ca woko, kacel ki lanebi ma lagoba, mayam obedo katiyo tic mogo me aura inyime, ma obwolo dano ma onongo dong kiketo lanyut pa lee ca ikomgi, ki mayam onongo giworo caleni. Gin aryonu ducu, lee ki lanebi ma lagoba, kibologi woko makwo i nam me mac, matye kalyel ki gweng calfa ma mac oliyo. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Jo mudonge ducu kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan pa ngat ma obedo iwi aguragura matar ni, ki pala lucwan ma okati ki idoge; ci winyi ducu guyeng woko ki ringo kom dano ma gucamo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaka alip acel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ka dok aneno lamalaika mo oa ki i polo kun lor bino piny; onongo omako layab me bur ma tere pe gik, ki nyor mapek adada. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Aca 3:1</ref></char></note> Ci omako min kulu madit ca, ma obedo twol macon ni, ma en aye Ladot dok Catan bene, ka otweye woko pi mwaka alip acel. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Lamalaika meno obole woko ibur ma tere pe gik, oloro dog bur woko, omwono woko bene kun oketo lanen iwiye wek pe dok omede ki bwolo rok ducu, nio wang ma mwaka alip acel dong okato. I nge meno myero kigonye woko pi kare mo manoknok.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:22">22</ref></char>
    </note> Lacen dok aneno komker mapol, jo ma gubedo iwigi obedo jo ma onongo kimiyo botgi twero me ngolo kop. Aneno bene tipu pa jo mayam kingolo ngutgi woko pi miyo cadengi ikom Yecu ki pi lok pa Lubanga, gin jo mayam pe guworo lee ca, nyo cale, dok bene ma yam pe guketo lanyute itur nyimgi nyo i cinggi. Gin doki gubedo kwo, gubedo kaloc kacel ki Kricito pi mwaka alip acel. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Jo ma oto mukenegu ducu pe dok gubedo kwo, nio wang ma mwaka alip acel dong okato. Man aye cer mukwongo. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Tye ki gum ngat ma bibedo i cer man mukwongoni, dok bene en dano maleng pa Lubanga kikome. Jo macalo meno, to me aryo pe tye ki twero mo ikomgi, ento gin dong gibibedo ajwaki pa Lubanga ki pa Yecu, dok bene gibibedo kaloc kacel kwede pi mwaka alip acel.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ka mwaka alip acel dong otum, ci lamalaika bigonyo Catan woko ki i buce. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:2">Eje 7:2</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Eje 38:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 38:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 38:15">15</ref></char></note> Ci Catan bikati woko cito ka bwolo rok ducu matye i but lobo, ma en aye Gog ki Magog, bicokogi bene pi lweny, jo ma welgi pe kwane ma girom ki kweyo me dog nam. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Gumol gucito guket woko iwi lobo ka malac ci gurumu gony pa jo pa Lubanga ki gang ma en maroni, ento mac oa ki i polo ci owangogi woko liweng. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Catan mayam obwologini bene kibolo woko i nam me mac ki gweng calfa ma mac oliyo, kama lee ki lanebi ma lagoba bene gitye iye ca; gibibedo ki arem nakanaka dyeceng ki dyewor.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:10">10</ref></char>
    </note> Dok aneno komker mo madit matar, ki ngat ma obedo iwiye. Lobo ki polo gua ki inyime guringo woko, ento pe dok kinongo kabedo mo pirgi. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ci aneno jo ma oto, jo ma rwomgi piny ki jo ma rwomgi malo, kun gucung inyim komker, onongo bene tye kenyo buk mogo ma kiyabo igi woko. Kiyabo bene buk mo mukene ma en aye buk me kwo. Kingolo kop ikom jo ma oto kun kilubu gin mayam gin gutiyo, kit macalo onongo kicoyo i buk magi. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Nam bene odwoko jo mayam guto i iyeni woko cen. To ki kabedo pa jo ma oto bene gumiyo jo ma oto mayam tye botgi; ci kingolo kop pa dano acel acel kun kilubu gin mayam gin gutiyo. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Kibolo To ki kabedo pa jo ma oto woko i nam mac. Nam me mac aye meno to me aryo. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Ngat mo mayam pe kinongo nyinge kicoyo i buk me kwo, kibolo woko i nam me mac.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Polo manyen ki lobo manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:17">Ica 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Pet 3:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka dok aneno polo manyen ki lobo manyen, pien polo mukwongo ki lobo mukwongo onongo dong gurweny woko, kadi wa nam bene onongo dong peke. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Ica 52:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:12">Niy 3:12</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:10">Ica 61:10</ref></char></note> Ci aneno taun madit maleng, Jerucalem manyen, kun oa ki i polo bot Lubanga bino piny, ma kiyubu woko macalo nyako ger ma kideyo pi cware. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Eje 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:11">Lev 26:11</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 26:12">12</ref></char></note> Ci awinyo dwon mo malongo ma oa ki i komker kun waco ni, “Nen, kabedo pa Lubanga dong tye bot dano. En bibedo kacel kwedgi, ci gin gibibedo jone. Lubanga kikome aye bibedo kwedgi, kun bene bedo Lubangagi. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ica 25:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:10">Ica 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65:19</ref></char></note> En bijwayo pig wanggi woko ducu. To dong bibedo pe, kadi kumu nyo koko, nyo arem, pien gin macon dong ducu gurwenyo woko matwal.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Ci ngat ma obedo iwi komker owaco ni, “Nen, atye kaketo jami ducu dong manyen.” Ka doki owaco ni, “Coo lok man, pien lok magi lok ma gene dok me ada.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ica 55:1</ref></char></note> Ci owaca ni, “Dong otime! An Alpha ki Omega, an acaki ki agiki. Ngat ma orwo neko, abimiyo mato pii me wang it me kwo labongo wel mo. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26">Jab 89:26</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 89:27">27</ref></char></note> Meno aye mot ma ngat ma oloyo binongo, ki an abibedo Lubangane, en bene bibedo latina. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ento jo ma lulworo, ma pe gin lugen, lutim tim mogo me kwer, lunek dano, lutim abor, lutim tim jokjok, luwor cal jogi, ki jo ducu ma gin lugoba, gibinongo mot ma kipoko botgi i nam matye kalyel mac ki gweng calfa; meno aye to me aryo.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Ci malaika acel ki ikin lumalaika abiro ma onongo gitye ki atabo abiro ma gemo abiro me agiki tye i igi ca, obino oloko bota kun waco ni, “Bin, anyuti Nyako ger, dako pa Latin romo.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Eje 40:2</ref></char></note> Cutcut lamalaika otinga, otera woko wa iwi got mo madit mabor tutwal, kun onongo Cwiny Maleng dong oyutu tama woko, ka onyuta Jerucalem, gang maleng, ma a ki i polo bot Lubanga bino piny, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />ma onongo tye ki deyo pa Lubanga. Onongo ryeny calo kidi me wel madit makato ducu, ma pe nen atata, calo jacipa, dok leng calo gweng ma mil amila. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Eje 48:30-35</ref></char></note> Cele onongo dit ocudu malo likung, doge onongo tye apar wiye aryo. Lumalaika apar wiye aryo onongo gitye i dogcel ducu, dok bene i dogcel onongo kicoyo iye nying kaka apar wiye aryo pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Dogcel adek onongo tye tung kunyango, tung acam dogcel adek, tung acuc dogcel adek, ki tung kupotoceng bene dogcel adek. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Cel me taun madit bene onongo tye ki te gutine apar wiye aryo, ki ikomgi onongo tye iye nying lukwena apar wiye aryo pa Latin romo.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Eje 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngat ma oloko kweda ni onongo tye ki odo me jabu me pimo taun madit ki dogcel ki cele bene. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Taun madit meno onongo yam twoke tye angwen ma giromrom, bore rom ki lace, ci opimo taun madit meno ki odoone, oromo kilomita alip aryo ki miya angwen; ma bore ki lace kacel ki bore me odok malo ducu romaroma. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />En bene dok opimo cel, ci oromo mitar pyere abiro nono ka kipimo ki bad dano, kit macalo lamalaika opimo kwede. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11">Ica 54:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 54:12">12</ref></char></note> Cel meno onongo kigero ki jacipa, ki taun madit meno kono onongo kigero ki jabu keken, ma nongo nen maleng calo kiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Teguti ducu me taun madit onongo kideyo woko ki lutino kidi me wel mapatpat. Mukwongo obedo kidi ma kilwongo ni jacipa, me aryo capir, me adek agat, me angwen emeradi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />me abic onik, me abicel karnelian, me abiro kuricolit, me aboro berul, me abongwen topaj, me apar kuricoparac, me apar wiye acel jacint, me apar wiye aryo ameticito. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Gin me loro dogcel apar wiye aryo ni onongo obedo tiko matar me wel gin apar wiye aryo, gin me loro dogcel acel acel kitiyo ki kit tikonu acel keken. Yoo ducu ma i taun madit meno kiyubu ki jabu keken, manen leng calo kiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Pe aneno ot mo me woro Lubanga i taun madit meno, pien ot me woro Lubanga ki kunu en aye Rwot Lubanga Won Twer Ducu kikome, ki Latin romo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Ica 60:19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:20">20</ref></char></note> Ceng nyo dwe pe bimite i gang meno me ryeny iye, pien deyo pa Lubanga aye dero matye kunu, ki tarane en aye Latin romo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">Ica 60:3</ref></char></note> Lengo matye iye bimiyo rok ducu giwoto maber; ki luker ducu ma iwi lobo gibikelo deyogi iye. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:11">Ica 60:11</ref></char></note> Pe kibiloro dog cele i dyeceng, ki dyewor bene bibedo peke kunu. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Kibitero iye deyo ki lonyo pa rok ducu. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Ica 52:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Eje 44:9</ref></char></note> Ento gin mo ma kome keni pe bidonyo iye, kadi ki ngat mo ma timo gin me kwer, nyo gin me goba, ento kono jo ma nyinggi dong kicoyo woko i buk me kwo pa Latin romoni keken.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eje 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Jek 14:8</ref></char>
    </note> Lamalaika dok onyuta nam me pii me kwo, ma mil amila ni makmak calo gweng ma mil, ma onongo mol kun a ki i komker pa Lubanga ki pa Latin romo, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aca 2:9</ref></char></note> onongo mol lubu dye yoo me taun madit meno. Dok bene i dog nam ryoryo onongo tye yat me kwo ma nyako nyige tyen apar wiye aryo i mwaka acel acel. Pot yat meno onongo obedo yat me cango two pa dano me rok ducu. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:11">Jek 14:11</ref></char></note> Gin ma kiceno pe dok binen kunu, ento komker pa Lubanga ki pa Latin romo aye bibedo iye, ki lutice gibiwore. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Gibineno wange, ki nyinge bene bibedo itur nyimgi. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Ica 60:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan 7:18</ref></char></note> Dyewor dong pe bibedo tye matwal; pe dok gibimito mac ma caro piny, nyo ceng, pien Rwot Lubanga bibedo ceng gi, ci gin gibibedo kaloc nakanaka.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bino pa Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ka dok lamalaika owaca ni, Lok magi lok ma gene, dok me ada. Rwot ma en Lubanga maloyo cwiny lutit loke dong ocwalo lamalaikane me nyutu bot lutice gin ma bitime ikare macokcoki. <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" /><char style="wj">Nen, dong acok bino. Tye ki gum dano ma lubu lok ma gitito i buk man.</char><verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />An aye Jon, ngat mayam owinyo lok man dok oneno gin magi ducu. Ikare ma awinyo lok man dok ma anenogi, cutcut aryebe woko piny katyen lamalaika ma onyuta gin magi ka amiye woro. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ento en owaca ni, “Pe omyero i tim kitmeno! An bene latic wadiwu, arom ki utmegini ma gin lutit lok pa Lubanga, ki jo ma gilubu lok ma kicoyo i buk man. Wor Lubanga.”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ka dok owaca ni, “Pe imwon lok magi ma gitito i buk man woko, pien kare dong cok. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12:10</ref></char></note> Wek lutim maracu kong gumede ki timo gin marac jo ma cilo me bal obwoyogi gumede ki bedo ki bal, ki jo ma kitgi atir myero gumede ki timo gin matye atir, ki jo maleng bene myero pud gumede ki bedo leng.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Ica 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62:11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 28:4">Jab 28:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Ica 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17:10</ref></char>
    </note> Yecu owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Nen, dong acok bino, kun akelo mota me pwoc, me culu dano acel acel muporo tic ma en otiyo.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Niy 1:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ica 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Niy 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">2:8</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">An Alpha ki Omega, mukwongo ki me agiki, acaki ki agiki.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:9">Aca 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3:22</ref></char>
    </note> Jo ma lwoko ginarukagi wek gibed ki twero me camo nyig yat me kwo, ki me donyo i gang ma nongo giwok ki i dogcel, jonu aye tye ki gum. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />I nge gang woko tye iye jo ma timo tim calo gin gwogi, lutim tim jokjok, lutim abor, lunek dano, ki luwor cal jogi, ki jo ducu ma maro loko goba, kun gitiyo bene gin me gobagoba.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ica 11:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="wj">“An Yecu dong acwalo lamalaikana me tito lok me caden botwu pi lwak jo muye an ducu ma gitye i kabedo ducu. An a lwit yat dok bene lakwar Daudi, an latwok maryeny tutwali.”</char> <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Ica 55:1</ref> </char></note> Cwiny Maleng kacel ki nyako ger gitye ka waco ni, “Bin!” Ngat ma owinyo lok man bene myero ogam ni, “Bin!” Ngat ma orwo neko myero obin, wek ngat ma mito bene omat pii me kwo labongo wel.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ladol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:2">Nwo 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:32">12:32</ref></char>
    </note> Dong aciko jo ducu ma guwinyo lok ma gitito i buk man, ni, kace dano mo dok omedo lok mo iye, Lubanga bene bimedo gemo ma gitito pire i buk kany ikome. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Dok bene kace ngat mo okwanyo lok mo woko ki ikom lok ma gitito i buk kany, Lubanga bene bikwanyo twerone me camo yat me kwo ki donyo i gang maleng, ma kicoyo pirgi i buk kany.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ngat mamiyo caden ikom lok magi bene owaco ni, <char style="wj">“Adada, binona dong cok.”</char> Amen. Bin, Rwot Yecu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Kica pa Rwot Yecu obed ki jo pa Lubanga ducu. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>